      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lares’ flag, the Bandera del Grito de Lares, is still the official flag of the municipality and a rallying symbol for Puerto Rican independence.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
