      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town sits in a mountainous, breezy area about 1.5 hours from San Juan, giving it a cool, dry winter climate ideal for hiking.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
